        <h2 class="relative z-10 font-extralight text-6xl md:text-7xl min-[1580px]:text-[5.75rem] tracking-tighter text-slate-900 leading-none text-right sm:pr-6 mb-[100px]">About me_</h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha: Texto -->
      <div class="md:col-span-6 text-slate-700 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-2 sm:space-y-6 pt-2 mx-6 sm:mx-0 mb-[40px]">
        <p class="text-[clamp(1.25rem,1.3vw,2rem)] font-semibold mb-4 sm:mb-8 text-slate-900 leading-relaxed">
          Hi, I´m <span class="text-brand-coral font-extrabold tracking-tight">Ana</span>
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-[1.75]">
          Bachelor of Fine Arts from the University of Granada, and an artist by nature. PLover of colors, shapes, strokes, and in short, of all visual stimuli, I decided that Design and Creativity would be not only my way of life, but my life.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm sm:text-base font-light leading-[1.75]">
          Reinvented as a digital designer and web developer, I create digital spaces where design and creativity merge with clean code and intuitive logic.
        </p>

        <!-- Bloque de Redes -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6">
          <a href={`mailto:${email}`} class="hover:text-brand-coral transition-colors decoration-slate-200 underline-offset-4">{email}</a>

						<a href={`tel:${tlf.replace(/\s+/g, '')}`} class="hover:text-brand-coral transition-colors decoration-slate-200 underline-offset-4">{tlf}</a>
						
						<div class="flex gap-4 items-center pl-2">
							<a href={linkedinUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-slate-700 hover:text-brand-coral transition-colors" aria-label="LinkedIn">
								<svg class="w-[20px] h-[20px]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
									<path d="M4.98 3.5c0 1.381-1.11 2.5-2.48 2.5s-2.48-1.119-2.48-2.5c0-1.38 1.11-2.5 2.48-2.5s2.48 1.12 2.48 2.5zm.02 4.5h-5v16h5v-16zm7.982 0h-4.968v16h4.969v-8.399c0-4.67 6.029-5.052 6.029 0v8.399h4.988v-10.131c0-7.88-8.922-7.593-11.018-3.714v-2.155z"/>
